20,2,1,talk,Servas,,The standardization records are grim. Four of six efforts ended without an owner. We must avoid orphaned projects.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room. We must pick a tool that fits the recurring budget.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Half the customer plants lose signal for afternoons. Also, our developers are busy until Q3. Field apps are risky.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,We lose an hour daily copying records. Eleven misrouted deliveries this year. The data duplication is a major leak.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
